						</p>
						<h3 class="mt-2 font-sans text-3xl font-medium text-brand-ink sm:text-4xl">
							Book a free opening chapter review.
						</h3>
						<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-ink/80 sm:text-base">
							Enter your email below and Hannah will send a private upload link for your opening pages,
							returning tracked edits and a 1-page diagnostic memo within 48 hours.
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- Right: Lead-Capture Input Field + Submit Button -->
					<div class="lg:col-span-6">
						<form id="lead-capture-form" class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
							<label for="lead-email" class="sr-only">Email address</label>
							<input
								id="lead-email"
								name="email"
								type="email"
								required
								autocomplete="email"
								placeholder="Enter your email address..."
